  "training": {
    "hints": [
      "Translate the lesson into explicit state and permissive logic: The cutter fires only at the target length and returns to home before the next cycle.",
      "Inputs are simulator feedback (cable_present, length_reached, cutter_home); PLC logic owns feed_run, cutter_fire.",
      "Test the initial state, the valid condition, and at least one missing permissive."
    ],
    "solution": {
      "summary": "This is an original functional reference for the control concept, not a copy of the photographed solution.",
      "steps": [
        "Require the documented inputs: cable_present, length_reached, cutter_home.",
        "Command the documented outputs: feed_run, cutter_fire.",
        "Remove PLC commands when the permissive is lost."
      ],
      "acceptance": "The cutter fires only at the target length and returns to home before the next cycle."
    },
